libgnome-desktop-4 (the C library)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This gem defines the GnomeDesktop namespace from libgnome-desktop-4's GObject
Introspection typelib at require time. It contains no libgnome-desktop source,
vendors nothing, and links nothing at build time: the typelib is read at
runtime from wherever the host installed it, and the dynamic loader resolves
the library behind it.

