ruby-gnome
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

GObjectIntrospection::Loader, which is what this gem is, comes from ruby-gnome.
The loader here follows the shape of ruby-gnome's own (gtksourceview5 and
libsecret in particular) and is a runtime dependency rather than a copy.

