On the data these lookups read
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The answers come from data files on the host rather than from this gem:
xkeyboard-config supplies the keyboard layout registry, hwdata the
monitor-vendor table, iso-codes and the system locale archive the country and
language names, and gsettings-desktop-schemas the GSettings schema XkbInfo
opens. A machine without them returns empty lists and nils, which is not a
fault in this binding.
